**(Nakarat – 1)**
Ya Rabb, adaletak urini
Zulm sayantahi, nur sayudri
Ya Rabb, qulubna quwi
Al-hurriya sa-tashruq bi-l-huri

*(Kısa duraklama, nefes alır gibi)*

---

**(Kıta 1)**
Shuja‘a qatalu bi ghayri khawf
Li ismi-ka ya Rabb yusami‘
Yathbilu lahum zulm wa ‘unf
Barbariyya tu‘addihum, la yasma‘u qalb

Alhuzn yazeed, al-usra tatafarruq
Kullu shakhs yabqa mu’ajjab ya Rabb
Lakinna al-zaman sayantahi
Wa kullu dhu haqq yanshuru al-fajr

---

**(Nakarat – 2)**
Ya Rabb, adaletak urini
Zulm sayantahi, nur sayudri
Ya Rabb, qulubna quwi
Al-hurriya sa-tashruq bi-l-huri

*(Tekrar hafifçe uzatılır, kalbe dokunan vurgularla)*

---

**(Kıta 2)**
Al-ahlam tatadammaru, al-‘uyun tabki
Al-‘uqul tusadd, wa al-qulub taktafi
La tahzan ya qalb, sabr wa shukr yadfi‘
Fa al-Rahman ma‘ak, nuruhu yudafi‘

Ash-shams turji‘ al-hayah ba‘d al-zulumat
Al-hubb wal-‘adl sayadhhabu ma‘a al-harakat
Al-mustaqbal yad‘u bik, ya hayyat al-ashkat
Fa qulubuna quwi, wal-ruh turtafiq bi-l-hayat

---

**(Nakarat – 3)**
Ya Rabb, adaletak urini
Zulm sayantahi, nur sayudri
Ya Rabb, qulubna quwi
Al-hurriya sa-tashruq bi-l-huri

*(Bu sefer nakarat uzatılır, “qulubna quwi…” kısmı üç kez tekrar edilir)*

---

**(Kıta 3 – Duygusal zirve)**
La yahlu ahadu, wa la yabqa
Al-hubb wal-karam sayabqa
Al-hurriya sa-tashruq bi dhurur
Ya Rabb, adaletak tatbiq, nurak yudhur

Ash-shaja‘a fi al-qulub la tanfadi
Al-amal wa al-iman sayudaffi
Ya Rabb, nurak yadhhabu al-zulumat
Wa qulubuna ma‘ak, tamlaku al-hurriyat

---

**(Nakarat – Final, uzun ve coşkulu)**
Ya Rabb, adaletak urini
Zulm sayantahi, nur sayudri
Ya Rabb, qulubna quwi
Al-hurriya sa-tashruq bi-l-huri
*(tekrar: Ya Rabb, qulubna quwi… 3x)*
Al-hurriya sa-tashruq bi-l-huri… *(yavaşlayarak ve kalbi vurgularla kapanış)*

